ould be independent of conditions, highlighting a flexible approach to strategy.","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":3},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8OgqRZkawv_tLMrbIK7CPWKd0vdnWkexI47C3M-GzgvSjVnJtCTH3LiQPeNTGE7ypGeBJU1L1NhhaVOSN1ZDSqSg8IVKBNEKR5aEvs2erhqrMgxnFX1jWQGEs9Yh9nz5YkNpIyoMmjx30ZUVBwA8bYy3rzvsMTyFC4m9_Ww72KSOKdddKqDGMN-Lkc-8Sh8HJrnOz04U6IS6QD-bpSCG_EGSIvkCiX0YC8m8RlDf7naWMmQQWLjzAlVP3br3DDrIY2xRRStqQvdUmq_GrzE3tyelwS9OHFW7EJAhHMWN_lyrzqMChrcJ5AvYjgnWFNMVPyO1-FM8emk093yc39PNi-uwYi-3itAuIeiZ1Lcul3CYw8YfBzArEvD-oYkHxQa8nqoyo9soQwxQpg3v3uKRoZJnFZT5Ise5f66GskSKpuKZO7WUM5mmCSrR4SbC0gZfUb0fbrLqf3FRgUb7jvBgAoiTAmObSpRemDuhGLNp6D54LAGLaiCQxa-zN0qUbjoA9fiUFSb9GuDmKu0cJzUzS0UrG2Z8gHvkt_u6ANvUzwbnPQGwkEdmjK4JeeYAjtpkAR3VcoRrNQRAv2Fx0r8qx_2dvZZqugMK_LKSJ3F3f83NwdT1rNrXbKDz2CQ9zMf56ieqHiJxG5jQKv6UfagDFIbojtO-Zo6zLA3loiFHJTvmmsMqHSGJCBhQap5d_eWIfAXu5kTD6AU6P4Y3CrX3sVNXJgdkH1NodprGoF2qk5wr7cHfoy-yqhylLQKFrkSXKQeVsMkk_rrVKsyVSGDSZa8FT5pFF8SCmbT3QqK5VB0cg7a9dGs62ZwjHw6k8FZnhN9NpEKvk4CN-Re5RfVQih0DGHfinSVI3F2O9r9yn2Q_FN_vTP-GJw38BQBQsjwSUIxzgLwhheW9S4442aVWETq509U3lVKcwI_JZJK5x5QvPHnwkJjxSNApG7Mx9VJXhv2ZH0ecvvfcZXOJfi3ilSFV0Ojx1t1n92HCFgfWY6XEDqHMM0MvGV__gvof2ZR9e5KJzNf_VTFECVCemI8_0d9YNaAZnQmGBK8ySTNpgsQA3OR54oFwfSY5dyQks249wwZXB3gger8-azcikZ0Hu3kS00Yd9cZQth7fAECWEvcxCgBeBWOzx_5zGrDPIdfmcWpeosLviiYncodIC3d4takvCtEmhAdrwXJIO-8lfk9yFPc5ipWSgeUjFPUnQc4GDrDyF_7VluCNAQwuh5_z7MrZkxYgcW5nZd5j02jz9QZKFmuRc8pr-197HrqtU3bv3BGINyWMjocRgM6BW3JPWjPqHUTcJRbGICYN5HgjGW17Ewyes2Sd9qT7cNKT2-qlw_nMyGD_6A9kTrA9uwWYNBPV4yhy8gdUtOoMDj-P5dky7h4xwyf2xw40RDNV1KrV_JdseNKbCQ8MA3lM4W7-AzSE5HfIiKjlGxpLEyK3Z4GcaEKdZlLHcCkLQm6djsKv9ZIU5Ro0J80_k3ripxdeg91zuSML8zHZh1NDreq7yzbqaC2nsKWY4I4EOztj1DJKI-UfSfEZjj9I_dMUTC6UrGqoFvlTyGD5J8ihNimVxlPEho0YU9K6DDIs9DZpP2ei14b7ql3AADljfqu0HXFmabBaChbAs-NehjFbBLdRz4VW4q_IM18DfKAzzHxoHtbTW7P07wNjIiojAy3A4hMLTyJRKy7527v1VBMiHINWhGUwjW8FvBqW9HX5T0fD13vxunvdpmYQgps71ruoIxXYYMZ6TxCMsWMljIZXKqG5SyU13-N9GiNewtetiDOyQqkHJSrdUnWFC7OSOvTJ-IoQaOmGaZ2-uplqqWdDZB